  "query_preview": "elsewhere. Warnings were issued where confidence is\ncurrently highest, but it's possible they may need to be\nextended for most of the Chesapeake Saturday. In a worst case\nscenario (low stronger and closer to the coast), gusts could\napproach storm force. Uncertainty increases Saturday night into\nSunday as the Nor'easter pivots near the New Jersey coast. At a\nminimum, Small Craft Advisory conditions will continue, but gale\nforce winds remain possible, especially along the Chesapeake.\n\nSCA conditions could continue over most of the waters through\nMonday as the Nor'easter impacting the region finally weakens \nand begins to push offshore. Sub-SCA winds return Monday night \nthrough mid week.",
